{"timestamp": "2026-08-05T18:53:35.366835Z", "level": "INFO", "logger": "pamo_sql", "message": "Stage 4 Complete. Final SQL selected: SELECT \n    s.CharterNum,\n    AVG(f.AvgScrWrite) AS AvgWritingScore\nFROM \n    schools s\nJOIN \n    satscores f ON s.CDSCode = f.cds\nWHERE \n    f.AvgScrWrite > 499 AND s.Charter IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY \n    s.CharterNum\nORDER BY \n    AvgWritingScore DESC;"}
