{"timestamp": "2026-08-05T19:30:50.265907Z", "level": "INFO", "logger": "pamo_sql", "message": "Stage 4 Complete. Final SQL selected: SELECT \n    s.School,\n    AVG(f.AvgScrWrite) AS AvgScoreWrite,\n    s.Phone AS CommunicationNumber\nFROM \n    schools s\nJOIN \n    satscores f ON s.CDSCode = f.cds\nWHERE \n    s.OpenDate > '1991-12-31' OR s.ClosedDate < '2000-01-01'\nGROUP BY \n    s.School, s.Phone;"}
